; AlgoX SuperTrend Pro EA - preset C1_Trend_Momentum
; Trend + momentum (ADX regime, MACD, RSI, volume)
; family: trend | hard filters: InpTrendFilterMode, InpMACDMode
; The documented combination: the higher timeframe trend (M15 EMA 50) is required and the MACD histogram must agree, while RSI (55/45 levels), the intraday regime (EMA 5/10/20) and the relative volume carry the rebalanced score weight. The trade targets TP2 with the stop moved to break-even at the TP1 distance, and it only fires when ATR(5) is at least 1.0 USD, ADX is strong and the geometry is at least 3x the spread - the research thresholds for a 0.47 USD spread on gold M1.
; Generated by generate_presets.py - do not edit by hand.
; Copy to MQL4/Presets and load it from the Inputs tab (Load button).
; Coherence rules: max 2 hard filters per family, max 5 in total,
; everything else inside a family stays on score so the filters do not fight each other.

